WEBVTT

00:01.927 --> 00:04.757
<b>[♪ somber music playing]</b>

00:04.887 --> 00:06.597
<b>-[whimpering]
-[CLINE] We've had enough.</b>

00:06.717 --> 00:08.137
<b>[gasps]</b>

00:10.727 --> 00:13.557
<b>Well, good luck
with your next party, at least.</b>

00:13.687 --> 00:15.067
<b>Then again, if I'm being honest,</b>

00:15.187 --> 00:17.487
<b>I can't imagine
who'd wanna recruit a loser</b>

00:17.607 --> 00:20.567
<b>who can't level up anymore
because of their awful build.</b>

00:20.697 --> 00:22.697
<b>-But who knows?
-[Ruche sobbing]</b>

00:24.197 --> 00:26.117
<b>[ELYMAS] They say relationships
only last</b>

00:26.237 --> 00:27.997
<b>as long as the money does.</b>

00:28.117 --> 00:31.117
<b>The skill point system
is particularly brutal.</b>

00:31.247 --> 00:34.207
<b>[Ruche sobbing]</b>

00:34.337 --> 00:36.877
<b>Didn't think
a Blood-Soaked Sword would drop.</b>

00:37.457 --> 00:40.757
<b>[giggling]</b>

00:43.087 --> 00:44.347
<b>[RUCHE] Seems like my skills</b>

00:44.467 --> 00:45.807
<b>really helped us out
quite a bit,</b>

00:45.927 --> 00:47.427
<b>don't you think?</b>

00:48.557 --> 00:51.097
<b>Aw. Come on, you guys.</b>

00:51.227 --> 00:53.187
<b>I thought they worked
pretty well, didn't they?</b>

00:55.817 --> 00:58.107
<b>So, you think you helped us?</b>

00:59.487 --> 01:02.027
<b>After visiting the dungeon
a bunch of times,</b>

01:02.157 --> 01:04.277
<b>we finally got this rare drop.</b>

01:04.407 --> 01:07.487
<b>So it was only a matter
of persistence and luck,</b>

01:07.617 --> 01:09.197
<b>not your skills.</b>

01:09.327 --> 01:11.077
<b>[ELYMAS] Could it be?</b>

01:11.207 --> 01:13.667
<b>- [Ruche sobbing]
- Does she have that skill tree?</b>

01:14.247 --> 01:15.627
<b>If he realized it,</b>

01:15.747 --> 01:17.667
<b>then he never would've
kicked her out like that.</b>

01:18.757 --> 01:20.587
<b>But based on what they said,</b>

01:20.717 --> 01:22.507
<b>I'm almost positive.</b>

01:22.627 --> 01:24.887
<b>She has a certain
rare skill tree</b>

01:25.007 --> 01:26.087
<b>that's utterly broken</b>

01:26.217 --> 01:28.057
<b>if you know how it works.</b>

01:28.177 --> 01:30.517
<b>[RUCHE] I'm so sorry
for being selfish!</b>

01:30.637 --> 01:33.057
<b>You don't ever
have to pay me again, okay?</b>

01:33.187 --> 01:35.227
<b>I promise! Please say
you'll keep me in the party</b>

01:35.347 --> 01:37.397
<b>-and I'll-- [gasps]
-[Elymas grunts]</b>

01:37.517 --> 01:39.937
<b>-[panting heavily]
-[gasps]</b>

01:40.067 --> 01:41.987
<b>Uh, who are you, mister?</b>

01:42.107 --> 01:43.947
<b>-[ELYMAS] Hear me out!
-[screams]</b>

01:44.527 --> 01:46.447
<b>-[BOTH] Huh?
-[Ruche screams]</b>

01:46.567 --> 01:48.367
<b>[Elymas panting]</b>

01:48.487 --> 01:50.697
<b>Please! There's nothing
to be scared of.</b>

01:50.827 --> 01:53.457
<b>I just want you
to form a party with me!</b>

01:53.577 --> 01:55.627
<b>A party?!</b>

01:55.747 --> 01:57.337
<b>[both gasp]</b>

01:57.457 --> 01:59.547
<b>[panting heavily]</b>

02:05.837 --> 02:08.887
<b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b>

03:40.147 --> 03:42.727
<b>♪</b>

03:43.857 --> 03:45.607
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

03:58.707 --> 04:01.077
<b>-How?
-Hmm.</b>

04:01.577 --> 04:03.957
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

04:06.667 --> 04:08.667
<b>Come on! If we form a party,</b>

04:08.797 --> 04:10.547
<b>you're not gonna regret it!
So, what do you say?</b>

04:10.677 --> 04:13.137
<b>Would an 80-20 split
work for you?</b>

04:13.257 --> 04:15.927
<b>[gasps] Uh, I couldn't do 20%.</b>

04:16.637 --> 04:19.347
<b>At that rate, it'd be almost
impossible to support myself.</b>

04:19.477 --> 04:22.397
<b>I meant that you would
be getting the 80%, of course!</b>

04:22.517 --> 04:24.267
<b>Is that okay?</b>

04:24.397 --> 04:25.647
<b>-[RUCHE] I'd be getting more?!
-[panting]</b>

04:25.767 --> 04:28.357
<b>Um, you think
you could calm down?</b>

04:28.487 --> 04:32.947
<b>And I'd prefer it
if you let go of my hand too.</b>

04:33.067 --> 04:34.617
<b>-Oh, please forgive me.
-[gasps]</b>

04:34.737 --> 04:36.697
<b>[CLINE] What the hell's
going on here?</b>

04:36.827 --> 04:39.577
<b>Mind telling me
who you think you are?</b>

04:39.707 --> 04:41.167
<b>I'm Elymas.</b>

04:41.287 --> 04:44.087
<b>I overheard that she's not going
to be in your party anymore.</b>

04:44.207 --> 04:46.917
<b>So I wanted to come out here
and scout her for mine.</b>

04:47.047 --> 04:49.587
<b>[Cline laughs]
Are you completely insane?</b>

04:49.717 --> 04:52.717
<b>In combat, her performance
is so piss-poor,</b>

04:52.837 --> 04:54.297
<b>she can't level properly.</b>

04:55.257 --> 04:57.887
<b>That's fine with me. No problem.</b>

04:58.017 --> 04:59.057
<b>[gasps]</b>

05:00.187 --> 05:01.557
<b>[grunts]</b>

05:04.017 --> 05:07.437
<b>[grunts, growls]</b>

05:07.567 --> 05:09.437
<b>-[Ruche whimpers]
-[laughs]</b>

05:09.567 --> 05:12.027
<b>Think so, huh?
Taking her off our hands</b>

05:12.147 --> 05:13.407
<b>would spare us some guilt.</b>

05:14.197 --> 05:16.737
<b>I just hope you don't regret
having this useless girl</b>

05:16.867 --> 05:18.077
<b>-in your party.
-[gasps]</b>

05:18.907 --> 05:20.247
<b>Oh, well.</b>

05:20.367 --> 05:21.957
<b>Go ahead and take her then.</b>

05:22.707 --> 05:25.247
<b>I wasn't asking
for your permission.</b>

05:25.707 --> 05:26.957
<b>What?</b>

05:27.087 --> 05:28.337
<b>[gasps]</b>

05:28.457 --> 05:29.547
<b>[sighs]</b>

05:31.677 --> 05:33.297
<b>[whimpering]</b>

05:35.927 --> 05:37.677
<b>[grunts]</b>

05:37.807 --> 05:39.467
<b>[whimpering]</b>

05:40.137 --> 05:43.227
<b>[Cline scoffs] What level
could you possibly be?</b>

05:43.347 --> 05:44.897
<b>Do you have
any other party members?</b>

05:45.017 --> 05:48.977
<b>I'm a Level 23
solo Heavy Knight,</b>

05:49.107 --> 05:51.397
<b>and an E-rank adventurer
as well.</b>

05:51.527 --> 05:54.697
<b>You're a Level 23
solo Heavy Knight?</b>

05:55.737 --> 05:58.827
<b>Someone like you should be able
to tell how worthless she is,</b>

05:58.947 --> 06:00.827
<b>so this makes no sense at all.</b>

06:01.497 --> 06:03.157
<b>Um, excuse me.</b>

06:03.287 --> 06:04.497
<b>Just so you know,</b>

06:04.617 --> 06:07.537
<b>I've only made it
to Level 13 so far.</b>

06:07.667 --> 06:09.417
<b>Maybe this isn't exactly
a good idea.</b>

06:09.547 --> 06:12.087
<b>Like I said, not a problem.</b>

06:12.207 --> 06:13.417
<b>[both gasp]</b>

06:14.257 --> 06:15.337
<b>Hmm.</b>

06:15.467 --> 06:16.797
<b>[growling]</b>

06:17.547 --> 06:18.847
<b>-[REISS] Hey. Tell me, Cline.
-Huh?</b>

06:18.967 --> 06:20.557
<b>What is it, Reiss?</b>

06:23.307 --> 06:24.727
<b>[in hushed voice] Don't you
think it's a little strange</b>

06:24.847 --> 06:25.807
<b>that an E-rank adventurer</b>

06:25.977 --> 06:28.977
<b>would try so desperately
to recruit Ruche?</b>

06:30.937 --> 06:32.437
<b>Hmm.</b>

06:32.567 --> 06:35.987
<b>Maybe her skills are more useful
than we realize.</b>

06:36.487 --> 06:38.567
<b>[ELYMAS]
I hope I didn't seem desperate.</b>

06:38.697 --> 06:40.947
<b>Did I come on
too strong earlier?</b>

06:41.447 --> 06:44.037
<b>This girl didn't do jack shit.</b>

06:44.157 --> 06:46.287
<b>-Yeah, but--
-Come on, that's enough, Reiss.</b>

06:46.827 --> 06:49.417
<b>Keep your mouth shut
and let her go, all right?</b>

06:49.537 --> 06:50.457
<b>[Reiss sighs]</b>

06:50.957 --> 06:53.257
<b>[CLINE] It's better for us
if she leaves quietly anyway.</b>

06:53.377 --> 06:54.297
<b>Believe me.</b>

06:54.877 --> 06:57.257
<b>Now, really think about this
for a minute.</b>

06:57.387 --> 06:59.007
<b>There's no way a Heavy Knight</b>

06:59.137 --> 07:01.597
<b>could have reached Level 23
all on his own.</b>

07:01.717 --> 07:02.967
<b>So he's either bullshitting,</b>

07:03.097 --> 07:04.977
<b>or he got kicked out
of his party.</b>

07:05.097 --> 07:07.057
<b>Then again,
he could be hitting on her.</b>

07:07.187 --> 07:09.227
<b>I mean,
Ruche does have a pretty face.</b>

07:09.607 --> 07:11.897
<b>Well, I suppose.</b>

07:12.017 --> 07:13.277
<b>[CLINE] Besides, this is going</b>

07:13.397 --> 07:14.527
<b>-to work out great.
-Hmm?</b>

07:14.647 --> 07:15.777
<b>We wouldn't want the rumor</b>

07:15.897 --> 07:17.647
<b>to spread around that
we kicked somebody out</b>

07:17.777 --> 07:18.987
<b>for their bad build.</b>

07:19.117 --> 07:21.947
<b>Then it'd be hard
to get new members.</b>

07:22.827 --> 07:25.117
<b>True. You have a point.</b>

07:25.247 --> 07:26.447
<b>[chuckles smugly]</b>

07:27.157 --> 07:28.207
<b>Hmm.</b>

07:29.537 --> 07:31.337
<b>Elymas!</b>

07:31.457 --> 07:33.667
<b>We've been waiting
for someone just like you.</b>

07:33.797 --> 07:35.877
<b>Now, be sure
to take good care of Ruche.</b>

07:36.007 --> 07:37.007
<b>[gasps]</b>

07:37.587 --> 07:38.967
<b>[groans]</b>

07:39.087 --> 07:40.087
<b>♪</b>

07:40.587 --> 07:42.557
<b>Uh, in that case...</b>

07:42.677 --> 07:44.967
<b>[panting]</b>

07:47.477 --> 07:48.637
<b>I accept.</b>

07:50.187 --> 07:53.017
<b>And I'm looking forward to it,
Mr. Elymas.</b>

07:54.317 --> 07:55.317
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:55.437 --> 07:57.317
<b>-[chuckles softly]
-So am I, Ruche.</b>

07:58.027 --> 08:00.487
<b>[giggling]</b>

08:01.067 --> 08:02.157
<b>[ELYMAS] I can't believe it.</b>

08:02.277 --> 08:04.527
<b>I just took on
my first party member.</b>

08:07.037 --> 08:09.117
<b>[CLINE] This is exciting,
isn't it?</b>

08:09.247 --> 08:10.997
<b>Congrats on your new party.</b>

08:11.127 --> 08:13.917
<b>You've never bought yourself
a decent weapon before,</b>

08:14.047 --> 08:15.377
<b>now have you, Ruche?</b>

08:15.507 --> 08:16.627
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:16.757 --> 08:18.007
<b>-[Cline scoffs]
-[coins clinking]</b>

08:18.127 --> 08:19.127
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:19.717 --> 08:23.137
<b>Think of this 100,000 gold
as a parting gift from us.</b>

08:23.257 --> 08:24.467
<b>[groans]</b>

08:24.967 --> 08:26.887
<b>Hope you'll use it well.</b>

08:27.017 --> 08:28.977
<b>[whimpering]</b>

08:31.397 --> 08:32.397
<b>Um...</b>

08:32.897 --> 08:36.487
<b>How terribly generous.
Thank you.</b>

08:38.107 --> 08:39.147
<b>-[ELYMAS] No.
-[Ruche gasps]</b>

08:39.277 --> 08:40.817
<b>-Don't touch those.
-Huh?</b>

08:40.947 --> 08:41.907
<b>[Cline grumbles]</b>

08:42.027 --> 08:43.737
<b>-[ELYMAS] Cline, was it?
-Hmm?</b>

08:43.867 --> 08:46.117
<b>I want you
to pick up every single coin</b>

08:46.237 --> 08:48.157
<b>-you tossed down there.
-[Cline grunts in anger]</b>

08:48.287 --> 08:49.577
<b>What's the matter with you?</b>

08:49.707 --> 08:51.617
<b>You honestly thought
you could throw them</b>

08:51.747 --> 08:54.207
<b>all over the ground,
then say it's some kind of gift?</b>

08:54.917 --> 08:57.417
<b>[seething]</b>

08:57.547 --> 08:58.467
<b>[gasps]</b>

08:58.917 --> 09:00.047
<b>[ELYMAS] Let's go, Ruche.</b>

09:00.167 --> 09:03.007
<b>But 100,000 gold
is a lot of money.</b>

09:03.137 --> 09:05.297
<b>Trust me, when it comes
to guys like him,</b>

09:05.427 --> 09:07.427
<b>you never want
to owe them anything.</b>

09:07.557 --> 09:09.347
<b>-[Cline grunts]
-Huh?</b>

09:09.477 --> 09:13.267
<b>-Uh, right.
-Who do you think you are?</b>

09:13.397 --> 09:16.897
<b>Have fun being useless together
with your defective classes!</b>

09:17.017 --> 09:19.687
<b>[growling]</b>

09:19.817 --> 09:20.857
<b>[grunts]</b>

09:20.987 --> 09:22.987
<b>-Come on, Reiss.
-Hmm?</b>

09:23.737 --> 09:25.487
<b>-Just one question first.
-[Cline gasps]</b>

09:25.617 --> 09:26.827
<b>-Can I have this money?
-[gasps]</b>

09:26.947 --> 09:28.197
<b>Are you kidding me?</b>

09:28.327 --> 09:29.367
<b>-[gasps]
-No, of course you can't!</b>

09:29.497 --> 09:31.327
<b>These coins are mine.
You got that?!</b>

09:31.457 --> 09:33.377
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

09:33.747 --> 09:35.337
<b>Oh, hey.</b>

09:35.457 --> 09:37.377
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

09:37.497 --> 09:40.337
<b>[WAITRESS] Be right there.
Please be patient.</b>

09:40.467 --> 09:42.877
<b>[chuckles] Thank you so much
for inviting me</b>

09:43.007 --> 09:44.387
<b>to join your party!</b>

09:44.507 --> 09:47.137
<b>I really appreciate it,
Mr. Elymas!</b>

09:47.757 --> 09:49.217
<b>Though, I still can't help</b>

09:49.347 --> 09:51.137
<b>feeling a little worried
about this too,</b>

09:51.267 --> 09:53.137
<b>because I just don't think
I'm powerful enough.</b>

09:53.887 --> 09:55.147
<b>[ELYMAS]
You don't have to worry.</b>

09:55.227 --> 09:57.267
<b>If we kill monsters
suited to your skill trees,</b>

09:57.397 --> 09:59.017
<b>-you'll level up.
-Actually...</b>

09:59.147 --> 10:01.237
<b>-Hmm?
-...you've been so kind to me,</b>

10:01.357 --> 10:03.317
<b>I wanted to ask, Mr. Elymas.</b>

10:03.447 --> 10:05.447
<b>Is the reason
you've been so helpful</b>

10:05.567 --> 10:07.367
<b>because you fell in love
at first sight?</b>

10:08.277 --> 10:09.947
<b>-[giggling]
-I beg your pardon?</b>

10:10.077 --> 10:11.037
<b>This whole time,</b>

10:11.457 --> 10:13.327
<b>I've been wondering why somebody
who's way above my level</b>

10:13.457 --> 10:15.877
<b>would ever
wanna stand up for me.</b>

10:15.997 --> 10:18.287
<b>And that's all
I could come up with.</b>

10:18.417 --> 10:22.167
<b>Uh, but to be fair,
I can be downright adorable.</b>

10:22.297 --> 10:23.257
<b>And I, um,</b>

10:23.377 --> 10:25.427
<b>I think
you're very attractive too.</b>

10:25.547 --> 10:27.047
<b>So please don't get me wrong.</b>

10:27.177 --> 10:28.547
<b>But maybe it'd be better</b>

10:28.677 --> 10:31.007
<b>if we just start out
as friends, okay?</b>

10:31.137 --> 10:33.427
<b>-[giggling]
-[grunting frustratedly]</b>

10:33.557 --> 10:34.887
<b>Although, I'm really flattered,</b>

10:35.017 --> 10:37.807
<b>you should know
I'm not that easy. Tee-hee!</b>

10:37.937 --> 10:39.357
<b>-Ruche.
-Huh?</b>

10:41.527 --> 10:45.357
<b>The Lady Luck skill tree.
You have it, don't you?</b>

10:46.357 --> 10:47.407
<b>Huh?</b>

10:49.367 --> 10:50.407
<b>What?</b>

10:51.327 --> 10:54.207
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

11:00.787 --> 11:02.297
<b>-Ruche.
-Huh?</b>

11:03.967 --> 11:07.797
<b>The Lady Luck skill tree.
You have it, don't you?</b>

11:08.887 --> 11:10.297
<b>Huh?</b>

11:12.007 --> 11:13.057
<b>What?</b>

11:13.767 --> 11:15.637
<b>[birds chirping]</b>

11:15.767 --> 11:17.597
<b>[♪ mysterious music playing]</b>

11:34.787 --> 11:36.407
<b>[Ruche sighs]</b>

11:41.837 --> 11:43.087
<b>[ELYMAS] In Magic World,</b>

11:43.417 --> 11:45.967
<b>dungeons are the nightmares
of the sleeping God of Creation,</b>

11:46.087 --> 11:47.717
<b>whose name is Alxeros.</b>

11:49.637 --> 11:51.847
<b>Over the span of an eternity,</b>

11:51.967 --> 11:55.177
<b>he created infinite gods
and worlds from nothing.</b>

11:55.307 --> 11:59.557
<b>But Alxeros, who reigned
as the everlasting supreme god</b>

11:59.687 --> 12:02.227
<b>and existed since the beginning
of time itself,</b>

12:02.357 --> 12:03.607
<b>lost his mind</b>

12:03.727 --> 12:06.687
<b>and was sealed away
by the very gods he created.</b>

12:09.027 --> 12:10.237
<b>However,</b>

12:10.367 --> 12:11.617
<b>his most frightening nightmares</b>

12:11.737 --> 12:13.657
<b>are beginning
to affect our reality.</b>

12:15.037 --> 12:17.537
<b>They're creating gates
in the real world,</b>

12:17.657 --> 12:20.457
<b>which are producing aberrant,
blood-thirsty monsters</b>

12:20.577 --> 12:21.827
<b>and malevolent demons.</b>

12:26.547 --> 12:27.507
<b>[gasps]</b>

12:27.627 --> 12:29.337
<b>-There it is.
-[gasps]</b>

12:33.177 --> 12:37.307
<b>Those are dungeons,
also referred to as Dreamholes.</b>

12:37.887 --> 12:39.807
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Angel's Playbox Entrance.</b>

12:39.927 --> 12:42.267
<b>Recommended level, 50.</b>

12:42.397 --> 12:43.897
<b>Are you positive you want me</b>

12:44.017 --> 12:46.067
<b>to go through with this,
Mr. Elymas?</b>

12:46.187 --> 12:48.527
<b>I mean, take a look at
what I have to offer.</b>

12:48.647 --> 12:50.987
<b>Do you see those stats?</b>

12:51.107 --> 12:52.697
<b>You should really
keep this private</b>

12:52.817 --> 12:54.277
<b>and not show other people.</b>

12:54.407 --> 12:56.157
<b>Are you being serious?!</b>

12:57.037 --> 12:59.497
<b>It's all right. I'm not worried.</b>

12:59.617 --> 13:00.907
<b>You seem pretty trustworthy,</b>

13:01.037 --> 13:02.627
<b>so I don't think
you'll tell anybody.</b>

13:03.327 --> 13:06.497
<b>Besides, it'd be better for you
to abandon me right now</b>

13:06.627 --> 13:08.337
<b>than to start
getting your hopes up</b>

13:08.457 --> 13:10.087
<b>only for me to disappoint you.</b>

13:13.177 --> 13:16.347
<b>I only have one attack skill
called Dice Thrust.</b>

13:16.467 --> 13:17.427
<b>And I can't even use that</b>

13:17.557 --> 13:19.637
<b>unless I get lucky
and roll a six.</b>

13:20.307 --> 13:22.477
<b>If I'd taken
The Fool's Acrobatics</b>

13:22.597 --> 13:24.357
<b>or put points
into Attack Booster,</b>

13:24.477 --> 13:26.567
<b>I wouldn't even be in this mess.</b>

13:26.687 --> 13:28.897
<b>[laughing awkwardly]</b>

13:29.027 --> 13:31.107
<b>Well, I really screwed up,
didn't I?</b>

13:31.237 --> 13:32.527
<b>It's all right.</b>

13:32.647 --> 13:33.697
<b>[gasps]</b>

13:33.817 --> 13:35.067
<b>[cape rustling]</b>

13:35.197 --> 13:38.657
<b>Truth is, I need you
more than you know.</b>

13:38.787 --> 13:42.117
<b>Huh? Uh, what does that mean?</b>

13:42.247 --> 13:47.917
<b>Um, I don't know too much
about that sort of thing.</b>

13:48.037 --> 13:50.547
<b>So you'll just have to be
a little more direct with me,</b>

13:50.667 --> 13:52.967
<b>or I won't understand
what you're saying.</b>

13:53.087 --> 13:58.137
<b>Uh, but I-- I suppose it's wrong
of me to say that.</b>

13:58.807 --> 14:00.807
<b>It's not fair
to either of us, is it?</b>

14:00.927 --> 14:02.227
<b>I am so sorry.</b>

14:02.347 --> 14:03.557
<b>Oh, of course.</b>

14:03.687 --> 14:05.977
<b>Now the two of us
are going to grind out</b>

14:06.107 --> 14:07.557
<b>an easy 30 million gold</b>

14:07.687 --> 14:10.277
<b>and get you up to Level 30
before we leave here.</b>

14:10.397 --> 14:13.447
<b>What?! So how the heck
are we supposed to do that?!</b>

14:18.367 --> 14:20.867
<b>-Let's go.
-All right.</b>

14:29.087 --> 14:30.837
<b>[whooshing]</b>

14:43.597 --> 14:45.437
<b>[cape rustling]</b>

14:48.607 --> 14:50.727
<b>[gasps]</b>

14:50.857 --> 14:52.147
<b>[grunts]</b>

14:57.067 --> 14:59.327
<b>[ELYMAS]
The recommended level is 50,</b>

14:59.447 --> 15:01.077
<b>but I'm familiar
with all the monsters</b>

15:01.197 --> 15:02.997
<b>-that spawn here.
-[gasps]</b>

15:05.787 --> 15:08.457
<b>We won't encounter
any serious danger.</b>

15:09.037 --> 15:11.377
<b>We're only going to stick
to the upper floors</b>

15:11.497 --> 15:12.877
<b>and grind levels for a while.</b>

15:13.007 --> 15:15.377
<b>I'll lure the enemies
over to me,</b>

15:15.507 --> 15:16.627
<b>then you can start
attacking them.</b>

15:17.467 --> 15:19.387
<b>Time to use
that Ironpiercer knife.</b>

15:19.967 --> 15:23.057
<b>I was nervous, but I still made
the decision to come this far.</b>

15:23.177 --> 15:24.847
<b>You even bought
this expensive knife</b>

15:24.977 --> 15:26.177
<b>for me to use out here.</b>

15:26.307 --> 15:28.937
<b>So there's no way
I'm gonna start wimping out now!</b>

15:29.057 --> 15:31.687
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Ironpiercer. Attack plus three.</b>

15:31.817 --> 15:34.687
<b>Market price, 550,000 gold.</b>

15:34.817 --> 15:37.317
<b>This knife is effective
against tough opponents.</b>

15:37.447 --> 15:39.987
<b>When damage is applied,
reduce the target's defense</b>

15:40.117 --> 15:42.617
<b>by 15%
before calculating damage.</b>

15:42.737 --> 15:45.327
<b>Don't worry, 'cause you can
count on me, Mr. Elymas!</b>

15:45.447 --> 15:46.577
<b>I'll do what I can to live up</b>

15:46.747 --> 15:49.127
<b>to your inexplicable confidence
and expectations!</b>

15:49.247 --> 15:50.327
<b>[grunting]</b>

15:50.497 --> 15:53.627
<b>Oh, good. Glad you're finally
feeling confident.</b>

15:53.757 --> 15:55.877
<b>[RUCHE] To show my gratitude
for this knife,</b>

15:56.007 --> 15:58.087
<b>I'll do everything I can
to protect you!</b>

15:58.217 --> 16:00.967
<b>[Elymas laughs]
My job's to protect you.</b>

16:03.007 --> 16:04.637
<b>-[PATCHWORK BEAR] Bear!
-[Ruche gasps]</b>

16:04.767 --> 16:05.887
<b>[PATCHWORK BEAR] Bear!</b>

16:06.017 --> 16:07.307
<b>[gasps]</b>

16:08.347 --> 16:12.187
<b>[PATCHWORK BEAR]
Bear! Bear! Bear!</b>

16:14.147 --> 16:15.737
<b>Bear!</b>

16:15.857 --> 16:18.147
<b>[ELYMAS] There it is.
A Patchwork Bear.</b>

16:18.277 --> 16:20.317
<b>It may look fluffy and adorable,</b>

16:20.447 --> 16:22.527
<b>but there is nothing cute
about its level.</b>

16:23.697 --> 16:25.577
<b>[ELYMAS] It has an attack of 22.</b>

16:25.697 --> 16:27.537
<b>So even if you manage
to get hit,</b>

16:27.657 --> 16:28.957
<b>-you'll still survive.
-[PATCHWORK BEAR] Bear!</b>

16:29.077 --> 16:30.497
<b>There's no way you'd be able</b>

16:30.627 --> 16:32.287
<b>to resist
a crit from that thing,</b>

16:32.417 --> 16:34.287
<b>but I can
shut it down completely</b>

16:34.417 --> 16:35.957
<b>by throwing the bear off balance</b>

16:36.087 --> 16:38.047
<b>-right as it's about to attack.
-[Ruche gasps]</b>

16:38.167 --> 16:41.177
<b>I don't get it. How do you
already know all that?</b>

16:41.297 --> 16:42.887
<b>-Huh?
-Be honest.</b>

16:43.007 --> 16:45.047
<b>-Do you like Patchwork Bears?
-[laughs awkwardly]</b>

16:45.177 --> 16:47.387
<b>[ELYMAS] No,
I can't say that I do.</b>

16:47.517 --> 16:49.427
<b>[PATCHWORK BEAR] Bear! Bear!</b>

16:49.557 --> 16:51.097
<b>[ELYMAS]
I'll take care of its attacks.</b>

16:51.227 --> 16:53.107
<b>Then you can strike
from its blind spots</b>

16:53.227 --> 16:55.187
<b>-and take it down.
-Uh, right!</b>

16:55.317 --> 16:57.487
<b>Watch out
for those claws and fangs.</b>

16:57.607 --> 16:58.567
<b>-Heard.
-'Kay.</b>

16:59.817 --> 17:03.067
<b>[PATCHWORK BEAR] Bear!</b>

17:05.197 --> 17:06.407
<b>Shadow Stomp!</b>

17:07.407 --> 17:09.077
<b>[ELYMAS] I bought this skill
with points</b>

17:09.197 --> 17:10.537
<b>from the Mad Headder fight,</b>

17:10.657 --> 17:13.377
<b>and now I can use it
to help Ruche level up.</b>

17:13.497 --> 17:15.957
<b>-[PATCHWORK BEAR] Bear! Bear!
-[grunts]</b>

17:16.497 --> 17:19.167
<b>My shadows can stretch
pretty far. Be careful.</b>

17:19.297 --> 17:21.087
<b>Uh. Yeah, I got it.</b>

17:21.757 --> 17:24.717
<b>Mm. Wait. You told me
I needed to watch out</b>

17:24.847 --> 17:27.767
<b>for its claws and fangs,
but I'm not seeing even one.</b>

17:27.887 --> 17:30.347
<b>Are you sure you were thinking
about the right monster?</b>

17:30.887 --> 17:32.017
<b>[Patchwork Bear growls]</b>

17:32.137 --> 17:33.227
<b>Huh?</b>

17:33.347 --> 17:35.517
<b>[Patchwork Bear grunting]</b>

17:43.777 --> 17:44.987
<b>[gasps]</b>

17:45.117 --> 17:47.197
<b>[Patchwork Bear roaring]</b>

17:47.987 --> 17:51.157
<b>-[Elymas grunting]
-[sword slashes]</b>

17:52.917 --> 17:54.667
<b>[gasps]</b>

17:55.537 --> 17:57.627
<b>[sighs] Glad I have this shield.</b>

17:57.747 --> 17:59.337
<b>Trying to survive attacks</b>

17:59.457 --> 18:01.377
<b>while staying
in the same spot is a pain.</b>

18:01.507 --> 18:02.667
<b>[Patchwork Bear grunts]</b>

18:02.797 --> 18:04.387
<b>'Kay. Your turn.</b>

18:04.507 --> 18:07.387
<b>-Attack till it's destroyed.
-Uh. Right!</b>

18:08.097 --> 18:09.177
<b>[pants]</b>

18:09.307 --> 18:10.927
<b>-[Patchwork Bear groans]
-[gasps]</b>

18:11.557 --> 18:13.267
<b>Well, this should be
a little easier.</b>

18:13.387 --> 18:15.187
<b>It doesn't even look cute now!</b>

18:17.147 --> 18:18.357
<b>[yells]</b>

18:18.477 --> 18:21.437
<b>-[grunting]
-[Patchwork Bear groaning]</b>

18:21.567 --> 18:24.697
<b>[grunts, yells]</b>

18:24.817 --> 18:27.117
<b>-[grunts]
-[Patchwork Bear groans]</b>

18:27.827 --> 18:28.907
<b>[Ruche gasps]</b>

18:30.947 --> 18:33.287
<b>That took more attacks
than I expected.</b>

18:33.407 --> 18:37.837
<b>But we still brought it down.
[sighs]</b>

18:37.957 --> 18:40.127
<b>Ruche, so how many levels
did you gain from--</b>

18:40.247 --> 18:41.417
<b>-What?
-[gasps]</b>

18:41.547 --> 18:43.877
<b>Come on, Mr. Patchwork Bear!
You can't do this!</b>

18:44.007 --> 18:46.797
<b>Please drop something!
Don't leave me hanging here!</b>

18:46.927 --> 18:49.557
<b>[sobbing] This is so awful!</b>

18:49.677 --> 18:51.557
<b>I'm going to be kicked out
of my party again.</b>

18:51.677 --> 18:52.767
<b>I just know it!</b>

18:52.887 --> 18:54.477
<b>-[crying]
-[ELYMAS] Hey.</b>

18:54.597 --> 18:55.807
<b>Don't worry, all right?</b>

18:55.937 --> 18:58.307
<b>We only killed it
for the EXP, anyway.</b>

18:58.437 --> 18:59.937
<b>I plan to kill a few more,</b>

19:00.067 --> 19:02.357
<b>so I'm sure something
will drop eventually.</b>

19:02.477 --> 19:03.437
<b>-[distant thudding]
-Hmm?</b>

19:03.567 --> 19:05.487
<b>-Huh?
-[PATCHWORK BEAR] Bear!</b>

19:05.607 --> 19:07.777
<b>[ELYMAS] Would you look at that?
Speak of the devil.</b>

19:07.907 --> 19:10.737
<b>Okay, same plan as before.
Let's go.</b>

19:10.867 --> 19:11.867
<b>Right!</b>

19:12.327 --> 19:15.327
<b>-[Elymas, Ruche grunting]
-[swords slashing]</b>

19:15.457 --> 19:16.707
<b>[grunts]</b>

19:17.207 --> 19:19.127
<b>-[Patchwork Bear groans]
-[yells]</b>

19:19.247 --> 19:20.747
<b>[Patchwork Bear groans]</b>

19:21.167 --> 19:22.627
<b>-[Patchwork Bear groans]
-[grunts]</b>

19:22.747 --> 19:23.707
<b>[crashes]</b>

19:24.757 --> 19:27.167
<b>[Ruche squeals delightedly]</b>

19:27.297 --> 19:29.677
<b>[laughs]</b>

19:30.297 --> 19:31.637
<b>Look at this!</b>

19:31.757 --> 19:33.467
<b>It was definitely
worth the wait!</b>

19:33.597 --> 19:36.637
<b>We finally got something!
They both dropped items!</b>

19:36.767 --> 19:38.687
<b>That's two in a row for us.</b>

19:38.807 --> 19:41.357
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Bear Shield. Defense plus 12.</b>

19:41.477 --> 19:45.987
<b>Market price, 200,000 gold.
A cute round Bear Shield.</b>

19:46.107 --> 19:47.527
<b>[RUCHE] I bet you're glad
you brought me</b>

19:47.647 --> 19:48.907
<b>out here now, right?</b>

19:49.027 --> 19:51.867
<b>-Will these things be useful?
-Huh?</b>

19:51.987 --> 19:54.327
<b>-Oh. Um, sure.
-[giggling]</b>

19:54.447 --> 19:55.657
<b>We might as well
take them with us.</b>

19:55.787 --> 19:58.117
<b>Okay. That sounds
like a great idea.</b>

19:58.997 --> 20:00.957
<b>-[ELYMAS] That's so strange.
-[giggling]</b>

20:01.087 --> 20:03.747
<b>These items don't usually drop
one after another.</b>

20:03.877 --> 20:06.257
<b>Did I misremember
the drop rate out here?</b>

20:06.377 --> 20:08.547
<b>-[giggling]
- Wait, that's right.</b>

20:09.257 --> 20:10.297
<b>[ELYMAS] Ruche's Cat's Paw skill</b>

20:10.427 --> 20:11.927
<b>is a special skill
that increases</b>

20:12.047 --> 20:14.517
<b>a player's luck by 500%.</b>

20:15.347 --> 20:16.807
<b>If she started out
with a luck stat</b>

20:16.927 --> 20:18.427
<b>that was fairly high
to begin with,</b>

20:18.557 --> 20:20.647
<b>then I suppose
all of this makes sense.</b>

20:20.767 --> 20:21.977
<b>[Ruche giggling]</b>

20:22.107 --> 20:24.527
<b>Didn't think
a Blood-Soaked Sword would drop.</b>

20:25.027 --> 20:27.067
<b>[Ruche giggles]
Seems like my skills</b>

20:27.187 --> 20:28.607
<b>really helped us out
quite a bit,</b>

20:28.737 --> 20:29.857
<b>don't you think?</b>

20:29.947 --> 20:32.867
<b>So it was only a matter
of persistence and luck,</b>

20:32.987 --> 20:34.827
<b>not your skills.</b>

20:35.697 --> 20:37.947
<b>[ELYMAS] But why didn't
Cline's party realize how much</b>

20:38.077 --> 20:40.327
<b>she was actually improving
their drop rate?</b>

20:40.877 --> 20:41.997
<b>After such a weak performance</b>

20:42.127 --> 20:43.377
<b>-like that--
-[ELYMAS] Oh, right.</b>

20:43.667 --> 20:46.047
<b>They couldn't see her value
because they're a newbie party.</b>

20:46.837 --> 20:50.587
<b>In this world, there isn't a lot
of information on monsters.</b>

20:50.717 --> 20:52.467
<b>They must have gotten used to
high drop rates</b>

20:52.587 --> 20:53.797
<b>from the very beginning.</b>

20:53.927 --> 20:55.007
<b>[giggles]</b>

20:55.097 --> 20:57.767
<b>How was that?
Am I being useful, Mr. Elymas?</b>

20:57.887 --> 21:00.227
<b>Yeah. Thank you.</b>

21:00.347 --> 21:02.897
<b>I'm really grateful that
you decided to team up with me.</b>

21:03.017 --> 21:05.067
<b>[squeals excitedly]</b>

21:05.187 --> 21:07.067
<b>[giggles]</b>

21:07.857 --> 21:09.317
<b>Guess you wanted
to get your hands</b>

21:09.437 --> 21:11.947
<b>on these little Bear Shields
pretty badly, didn't you?</b>

21:12.067 --> 21:13.777
<b>Should we collect
10 more of them?</b>

21:13.907 --> 21:16.367
<b>[ELYMAS] No.
You've gained enough levels.</b>

21:16.487 --> 21:18.367
<b>The real work starts right now.</b>

21:18.487 --> 21:20.157
<b>Mm. Huh?</b>

21:20.657 --> 21:22.457
<b>[AUTOMATED VOICE]
Level 20 has been reached.</b>

21:22.577 --> 21:25.457
<b>[RUCHE] Oh, wow! You're right!
When did that happen?</b>

21:26.087 --> 21:27.747
<b>-[giggles]
-[ELYMAS] At this point,</b>

21:27.877 --> 21:28.877
<b>the new goal for us</b>

21:29.587 --> 21:31.587
<b>is hunting Golden Raana.</b>

21:31.717 --> 21:32.887
<b>[gasps]</b>

21:33.507 --> 21:36.297
<b>[RUCHE] Uh, Golden Raana?!</b>

21:37.507 --> 21:38.557
<b>[croaks]</b>

21:40.727 --> 21:42.887
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>

23:10.567 --> 23:13.107
<b>[ELYMAS] So far, Ruche's power
is even more impressive</b>

23:13.227 --> 23:14.237
<b>than I thought it'd be.</b>

23:14.737 --> 23:16.277
<b>But I know it's only</b>

23:16.397 --> 23:18.527
<b>a small fraction
of what she can do.</b>

23:19.157 --> 23:22.197
<b>No, I'm not referring
to those two Bear Shields.</b>

23:22.327 --> 23:23.657
<b>I'm not equipping them.</b>

23:24.657 --> 23:25.867
<b>In any case,</b>

23:25.997 --> 23:27.037
<b>the two of us can finally</b>

23:27.207 --> 23:29.537
<b>focus on what we came
to this dungeon for.</b>

23:29.667 --> 23:31.167
<b>With everything else
out of the way,</b>

23:31.297 --> 23:33.757
<b>the real work starts right now.</b>

23:33.877 --> 23:36.627
<b>Next time,
"Golden Raana Farming."</b>

23:36.757 --> 23:39.887
<b>Every game should have
at least one bonus character!</b>
